  "semantic_decision": {
    "choice": "Use сингулярные примарные числа for the historical technical term; retain первичный elsewhere according to sense.",
    "reason": "German ED0015 distinguishes technical Primärzahlen from ordinary Primzahl l in the same sentence. The 1940 Russian Hecke translation names the matching reciprocity-theory topic Сингулярные примарные числа, and an independent Russian research article uses примарное число in the same higher-reciprocity domain. The change therefore restores both technical predicates instead of paraphrasing them as особые and первичные.",
    "rejected": [
      "keeping особые первичные числа, because it erases the historical technical register and collides lexically with the separate первичн- house register",
