      "особые примарные числа, because особые remains an unmotivated paraphrase of singulär",
      "changing relational первичны/вторичны",
      "changing Paper 14 primary ideals or reversing the sealed primary-ideal house policy",
      "any global примарн-/первичн- replacement"
    ],
